949 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 445 0 R
/E (IDP has indeed changed my perspective when viewing websites and applications. I have learnt that there is so much more behind each and every design. Through brainstorming, parallel prototyping, drawing, evaluating & experimenting, each phase of this project has pushed me to become more creative, giving me deeper insight as to how intricate the design process is. It also gave us a hands on experience to truly understand the applicability of the content we learned in class. Overall, idp has made me more aware and appreciative of the designs of website and applications in my life. )
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
