953 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 445 0 R
/T (IDP has taught me the complexities that go behind UI design. Even seemingly simple design choices like font and colour and heavily affect how a user views an app. This is why there is a need for constant prototyping, trial and error with user testing to figure out whether what we have is what users need. One important concept I will never forget is the "Nielsen's 10 heuristics".)
/E (IDP has taught me the complexities that go behind UI design. Even seemingly simple design choices like font and colour and heavily affect how a user views an app. This is why there is a need for constant prototyping, trial and error with user testing to figure out whether what we have is what users need. One important concept I will never forget is the "Nielsen's 10 heuristics".)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
